#!/bin/bash
set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
IPA client enrollment scaffold
==============================

Domain: {{ resolved_ipa_client.domain }}
Realm: {{ resolved_ipa_client.realm }}
Join mode: {{ resolved_ipa_client.domain_join_mode }}

Rendered files:
  /etc/ipa/default.conf
{% if resolved_ipa_client.configure_krb5 | bool %}
  /etc/krb5.conf
{% endif %}
{% if resolved_ipa_client.configure_sssd | bool %}
  /etc/sssd/sssd.conf
{% endif %}

Recommended enrollment flow:
  1. Ensure DNS and time sync reach the identity controller.
  2. Obtain a host enrollment principal or one-time password from the FreeIPA controller.
  3. Run ipa-client-install or the equivalent overlay-managed enrollment helper.
  4. Start sssd and verify getent/ssh/sudo behavior against the domain.
EOF
